{"h":3406,"w":2400,"lines":[{"y":0.046388725720355684,"h":0.017615971814445075,"w":0.33814432779947917,"x":0.074226805065367496,"c":1,"t":"Sample answers for Writing tasks"},{"t":"TEST 4, WRITING TASK 1","y":0.095930232630288992,"h":0.021803178860030914,"x":0.072164946122564591,"c":1,"w":0.38144330342610677},{"w":0.2144329833984375,"x":0.0742268071657399,"c":1,"h":0.014679976512037562,"y":0.13358778603095245,"t":"SAMPLE ANSWER"},{"h":0.016147974163241319,"w":0.83917526245117169,"y":0.17146212548929407,"x":0.072164945989358575,"t":"This is an answer written by a candidate who achieved a Band 7 score. Here is the","c":1},{"y":0.18826321647955602,"x":0.072021894780167822,"w":0.21685109456380205,"h":0.01673620249758867,"t":"examiner's comment:","c":1},{"t":"The candidate covers the main features of the table and charts, and gives a","h":0.020749722098296175,"c":1,"x":0.11947731595817401,"y":0.2240723705661587,"w":0.7651885477701823},{"x":0.1195876352684372,"w":0.78350514729817722,"c":1,"y":0.24418604658011456,"h":0.017441859892096456,"t":"satisfactory overview of the data. The information is logically organised with a"},{"h":0.015990078624248283,"w":0.78762888590494795,"t":"clear progression in the way points are presented. Cohesive devices are used","y":0.26453317701736423,"c":1,"x":0.1195876187573767},{"t":"effectively (during the same two periods), but not always accurately (on a contrary).","x":0.1195286602702032,"h":0.020163219673662969,"c":1,"w":0.84342686971028646,"y":0.28164102724785889},{"c":1,"t":"A range of vocabulary is used flexibly (shows a negative pattern, illustrates that,","x":0.11958762696643532,"y":0.30087209286359129,"w":0.80824742635091151,"h":0.01889534914976565},{"t":"an upward trend, has reached its aim), but there are occasional errors in word","x":0.11958761884576546,"y":0.31972988820680226,"c":1,"h":0.017615971814445186,"w":0.78762888590494784},{"y":0.33720930215868794,"h":0.018926928481562744,"c":1,"w":0.83711339314778654,"t":"choice (the amount of visitors, It is obviously). The candidate has used a variety of","x":0.11958763309366152},{"w":0.82268040974934897,"h":0.017441859892096456,"c":1,"y":0.35610465144226766,"t":"complex structures (the charts that show the result of surveys asking people how","x":0.11752577460404193},{"w":0.81443298339843739,"y":0.37492659984136523,"h":0.017615971814445186,"t":"satisfied they were with their visit, after the refurbishment from 74,000 before the","x":0.11958763190596955,"c":1},{"t":"reconstruction to 92,000 after it had been done). There is good control of grammar,","x":0.11958762640395605,"y":0.39389534856086317,"w":0.83917526245117191,"h":0.017441861012089888,"c":1},{"w":0.8391752624511718,"c":1,"x":0.11958762702183671,"y":0.41133294167985124,"t":"although there are a few minor errors (there is the charts). Punctuation is generally","h":0.017446127626661978},{"c":1,"y":0.43012331140537674,"t":"well controlled, but full stops are missing at the end of the first and final paragraphs","x":0.11958763155791909,"w":0.83917526245117191,"h":0.019083969465648942},{"t":"and there are a few minor errors (lets look).","x":0.11937554742357524,"w":0.43970108032226551,"h":0.0226549337838442,"y":0.44553865557763261,"c":1},{"t":"The table below shows the amount of visitors to Ashdown Museum during the years","y":0.48205734841252301,"w":0.83534357706705742,"c":1,"x":0.074081766432419247,"h":0.022661332305711102},{"y":0.50320430143040495,"w":0.84550323486328127,"c":1,"t":"after and the year before it was modernized. After the table. there is the charts","h":0.020594049746053611,"x":0.070020756641706802},{"x":0.072164957247101147,"t":"that show the resutt of surveys asking people. how satisfied they were with their visit","h":0.017615971814445075,"w":0.87422678629557293,"c":1,"y":0.5246623603267524},{"w":0.42680414835611974,"y":0.54492072804544189,"h":0.013218806900140878,"t":"thos museum, diring the. same two periods","c":1,"x":0.070103080355971056},{"t":"It is obviously that the numbers of visitors significantly increased after the.","x":0.070103086377147961,"c":1,"w":0.7711340332031249,"y":0.56976744170139182,"h":0.018899616324334567},{"h":0.016127421165730627,"t":"refurbishment from 74,000 before the reconstruction to 92,000 after it had been done.","y":0.58713739497973605,"c":1,"x":0.070057821021576289,"w":0.87639282226562487},{"x":0.070042919689467645,"c":1,"y":0.60496014940472287,"w":0.88671773274739585,"h":0.019646078435659242,"t":"Now lets look. at the charts. The year before refurbishment shows a negative pattem:"},{"y":0.62499999972354703,"h":0.017441861012089777,"c":1,"x":0.070103068039139294,"w":0.85360829671223959,"t":"the resilt's of survey illustrate that only 15% of visitors were very satisfied and the"},{"t":"number of dissatisfied people. was 40%. The year after refurbishment illustrates that","x":0.065979400706069669,"y":0.64386376934527778,"w":0.85567006429036463,"c":1,"h":0.018926928481562855},{"h":0.017615971814445075,"c":1,"x":0.068041252751328996,"y":0.66265413997212774,"w":0.87216491699218757,"t":"the number of dissatisfied visitors declined and became. 15%, on a contrary, people who"},{"h":0.019699963554521194,"w":0.8908982340494791,"x":0.070014471685069191,"y":0.67833378372508879,"c":1,"t":"were very satisfied increased to 35%. Comparing the amount of satisfied visitors we can"},{"w":0.82688349405924477,"c":1,"y":0.69791377763561047,"x":0.070055193656629822,"t":"also see an upward trend lit increased from 30% to 40% after the. refirbishment).","h":0.016068041359615259},{"h":0.016147974163241319,"y":0.72665883711989809,"c":1,"w":0.85567006429036452,"t":"To sim up, we can say that all work that has been done to attract new visitors to","x":0.072164967611518777},{"h":0.015899979641209372,"y":0.74408120136540545,"t":"Ashdown Museum has reached its aim","x":0.069911386937839812,"c":1,"w":0.3694109598795573},{"h":0.01453488361674482,"c":1,"y":0.95494186045114138,"t":"138","w":0.037113402684529617,"x":0.065979381075729565},{"c":1,"y":0.95282063013090734,"x":0.35215266672267659,"w":0.29360794067382817,"t":"leltsresources.org","h":0.024127928845265045}]}